or at least reduce the random teleport.  I find myself many times moving
around and then keep getting stupid messages because the teleport control
doesn't understand , (pickup) or :/ (look) ect.  Usually I curse and just
press the . to not teleport anywhere.  (It is rare that I use a random
teleport to go somewhere else.  Surely a more experienced player will master
the urge to teleport eventually.

Another suggestion could be some sort of tiredness factor, even a strong
caveman type would be tired out by a long battle and have a slightly reduced
chance to hit and reduced damage.  (Consider the film type scenes where two
equal knights battle for a long time, eventually both collapsing exausted.)
The recovery time would decrease as the player becomes fitter.

